cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "L2CO: Learning to Choose Optimizers"
abstract: >-
  A research framework that learns to select from a set of static optimizers
  (Adam, SGD, CMA-ES, etc.) based on problem features and optimization history,
  rather than designing a new optimizer from scratch. Built on JAX/Equinox.
authors:
